Why This Is Asked: Tests ability to design progressive delivery with multi-region, no manual hacks. Key Concepts: Cloud Deploy pipelines, region-scoped traffic controls, Cloud Run traffic splits, Cloud Monitoring alerting, automatic rollback, minimal IAM. Code Example:```javascript
const deployConfig = {
  pipeline: 'region-canary',
  stages: [
    { region: 'us-east1', canary: 0.05, durationMin: 20 },
    { region: 'global', canary: 0.20, durationMin: 30, guard: 'latency<0.85' }
  ],
  rollback: 'setTraffic(v3)';
};
```

## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to automate cost governance using Cloud Billing budgets and Pub/Sub, plus implement a rollback flow for Cloud Run without manual intervention. Demonstrates familiarity with per-revision traffic, triggering events via native tools, and applying least-privilege IAM.

## Key Concepts

- Cloud Billing budgets and alerts
- Pub/Sub as event sink
- Cloud Functions automation
- Cloud Run per-revision traffic management
- IAM least privilege

